    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "ABOUT KEY LIME PIE:<br>Welcome to Key Lime Pie, nestled in the serene neighborhood of Inlet Beach, Florida. This property boasts a private pool complete with a charming pool house, offering the perfect oasis for relaxation and enjoyment under the Florida sun.<br><br>Guests will have the pleasure of exploring the surrounding area with ease, as the home comes equipped with a 6-seater golf cart and four complimentary bikes. Whether it's cruising along the scenic streets or venturing to the nearby white sand beaches, guests will have convenient and stylish transportation options at their disposal.<br><br>This spacious and well appointed home is ideal for families or groups seeking a peaceful retreat in a tranquil setting. With six well-appointed bedrooms, there is ample space for relaxation and privacy for all guests. The indoor living areas are tastefully designed for comfort and style, while the outdoor spaces offer opportunities for al fresco dining, lounging by the pool, or simply enjoying the beautiful Florida weather.<br><br>Experience Key Lime Pie in the charming Inlet Beach, where every detail has been thoughtfully curated to ensure a memorable and relaxing stay.<br><br>​​​​​​​ABOUT THE AREA:<br>Inlet Beach is a charming beach neighborhood located along Florida's scenic Highway 30A. Known for its stunning white sandy beaches, crystal-clear waters, and relaxed atmosphere, Inlet Beach offers a peaceful coastal getaway for visitors seeking a more laid-back vacation experience. This quaint community is characterized by its quiet residential streets lined with beautiful beach cottages and upscale vacation homes, perfect for those looking to unwind and enjoy the natural beauty of the Gulf Coast.<br><br>Inlet Beach provides easy access to a variety of outdoor activities, including swimming, sunbathing, paddleboarding, kayaking, and fishing. The nearby Camp Helen State Park offers nature trails for hiking and birdwatching, while Lake Powell - one of Florida's largest coastal dune lakes - provides opportunities for boating and wildlife viewing. Visitors can also explore the neighboring beach communities of Rosemary Beach, Seacrest Beach, and Aly's Beach, each offering unique shopping, dining, and entertainment options.<br><br>With its pristine beaches, serene ambiance, and proximity to a wealth of recreational opportunities, Inlet Beach is a hidden gem along Highway 30A, perfect for those seeking a peaceful retreat on Florida's Gulf Coast.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS:<br>* Wall street public beach access.<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>* 2 minute walk to the beach.<br>* Pool Heat Optional<br>* 4 bikes included.<br><br>PARKING:<br>* Free Parking up to 4 Vehicles.<br><br>PROPERTY RULES:<br>* Must sign rental agreement within 48 hrs of booking or subject to cancellation<br>* If you choose to bring your dog/s, there is an additional, non-refundable pet fee of $250 per dog. The fee is to be charged after reservation confirmation.<br>* Must Be 25 years or older<br>* Optional pool heat: $90 per day.<br><br>DISCLOSURE:<br>Please be aware this area has a lot of development and new construction going on. At any given point adjacent properties to properties we manage may go under construction to which we are not notified. Paradise Properties is not liable for any construction happening outside of the properties we manage.<br><br>ABOUT PARADISE PROPERTIES:<br>When you book your vacation in Florida's Panhandle with Paradise Properties Vacation Rentals and Sales, you can expect first class customer service from the moment you inquire. All of our properties are professionally cleaned, inspected, and maintained at the highest level. We are located close to all of our properties and we are available 24 hours per day and 7 days per week to ensure your vacation is flawless. Our goal is to build a lasting memory for all of our guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
