        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We had a good stay at Key Lime for a larger family gathering with kids and dogs. The size and layout of the home make it well suited for larger groups. The location, with its proximity to Rosemary Beach and the beach, is hard to beat. The home itself has some wear and tear but everything worked. We found it to be a good value given the size, location, and amenities. There is a small but sufficient area of public beach at the end of Winston Ln.",
